<title>INDIA: India produced 4,473 tonnes lead in January.</title>
<headline>India produced 4,473 tonnes lead in January.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 4,473 tonnes of lead in January 1997 compared with 4,138 in December 1996, a government statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>The country produced 36,439 tonnes of lead during April-January 1997 compared to 36,358 tonnes in the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed  January,1997    Cumulative output</p>
<p>	   capacity   -------------    -----------------</p>
<p>	   (annual)    Actual	  Apr 96-Jan 97  Apr 95-Jan 96</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> HZL	 65,000     3,060	   22,757	   21,688</p>
<p> ILL</p>
<p> Secondary 24,000     1,413	   13,682	   14,670</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total     89,000     4,473	   36,439	   36,358</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91 11 301 2024</p>
</text>
